Smoke 'n' Roll
==============

"Smoke 'n' Roll" is a
[demoscene](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demoscene) production for 
[Atari 8-bit computers](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atari_8-bit_family).

It uses a 320x192 mode with random dithering (256 shades)
as introduced in my 2021 32-byte intro
[Dither City](https://github.com/pfusik/korporazka).

Credits
-------

Design and programming by Piotr '0xF' Fusik

