- [xasm](https://github.com/pfusik/xasm)
- [SciTE](https://scintilla.org/SciTE.html)
- [Altirra](https://www.virtualdub.org/altirra.html)
- GNU Make
- [Cursor](https://cursor.com) for a small bug fix
